OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to rule on Drumcree High
OL,4,ACourt legal challenge next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court bid to overturn the
OL,7,Fsecretary of state's decision to ban
OL,8,Fthe Drumcree parade has concluded, with
OL,9,Fthe judge saying he will rule on the
OL,10,Fmatter next week.
OL,12,FThe legal challenge was brought by a
OL,13,Fmember of the Portadown Orange lodge.
OL,15,FOn day two of the hearing, Mr Justice
OL,16,FScoffield heard legal arguments by
OL,17,Fbarristers for Sir Chris Bryant and
OL,18,FGarvaghy Road residents.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
