OL,3,GNEWSAJudge to rule on Drumcree High
OL,4,ACourt legal challenge next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhilip McAteer, the barrister
OL,7,Frepresenting Sir Chris, said had the
OL,8,Fminister not stepped in, the stand-off
OL,9,Fwould have continued with "escalating"
OL,10,Frisk.
